{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09519","headline":"和司空曙刘眘虚九日送人 · 孙昌胤","name":"和司空曙刘眘虚九日送人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"京邑叹离羣，江楼喜遇君。\n开筵当九日，泛菊外浮云。\n朗咏山川霁，酣歌物色新。\n君看酒中意，未肯丧斯文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙昌胤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}